WEBVTT

01:16:02.674 --> 01:16:04.091
Oh, Bo.

01:16:04.176 --> 01:16:06.594
There's got to be a less painful way
to get my attention.

01:16:06.678 --> 01:16:08.763
Merry Christmas, Sheriff.

01:16:09.890 --> 01:16:12.308
Say, isn't that mistletoe?

01:16:14.811 --> 01:16:18.314
Maybe Andy will get another dinosaur.
Like a leaf eater.

01:16:18.398 --> 01:16:21.776
That way I could play
the dominant predator.

01:16:21.860 --> 01:16:22.902
Quiet, everyone! Quiet!

01:16:22.986 --> 01:16:26.656
Molly's first present
is Mrs Potato Head.

01:16:26.740 --> 01:16:28.783
Repeat, a Mrs Potato Head.

01:16:28.867 --> 01:16:30.952
Way to go, Idaho!
